SISO-REF-010 enumerations — license and attribution
==================================================

The committed tree carries only the schema/API material from the official
SISO distribution: SISO-REF-010.xml, SISO-REF-010.xsd, the RPR-Enumerations
XMLs, the XSL transforms, the Makefile, and the distribution README.txt.
Under the license below these are royalty-free for all purposes with the
attribution “Reprinted with permission from SISO Inc.” The document
renditions (the v37 .doc/.htm/.pdf/.xlsx enumerations files) and the
SISO-REF-010.1-2019 Operations Manual are licensed for noncommercial
purposes only, so since tag v0.9.0 they are not redistributed in the tree
and are purged from git history (the v37-docs tag was rewritten to a
docs-free commit accordingly); they are kept locally under the gitignored
.references/ directory. The distribution's own license text follows
verbatim.

